-ae43-b28b44cbbe26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c6b697cc1d3c1e28ea3f9b0f4fdbeea", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4820db35/uploads/origins/7f20d902-8e47-4128-ae43-b28b44cbbe26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c6b697cc1d3c1e28ea3f9b0f4fdbeea, https://si.imgix.net/4820db35/uploads/origins/7f20d902-8e47-4128-ae43-b28b44cbbe26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4212116cb9deca110e6b8e9cddc77ef6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4820db35/uploads/origins/7f20d902-8e47-4128-ae43-b28b44cbbe26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d5d499d3509f389db3f7b380351723b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hey!! I love your art, and I’d be interested in you helping draw my original character.\n\nThe main priority I want my character to have is short lengthed hair ending to the shoulders, similar to Yui’s hairstyle from K-On. \n\nI’d also wish for her to have really dark brown hair that’s hitting close to looking black but isn’t entirely there. \n\nSaori from Oreimo is a character I admire because of her swirly glasses, and I wish for my character to have her exact glasses as well. (I want the glasses to be hanging on the nose where they’re still wearing them, but you could still see their eyes slightly.)\n\nAs for the clothing, I want my character to be wearing something similar to the school uniform Hinata wears from Wataten, including the thigh highs. Her having blue colour nails and acting/posing being moe would be nice as well.\n\nHere’s some additional stuff for the character:\n\nHeight: 155cm\nGender: female\n\nUsage of this commission: character design sheet reference & pfp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pipi__kun/works/77", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8dea2fd/uploads/origins/695f3f35-c77b-4edc-aa33-cbd6dab9fc95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop